    deployed_selfhost_test_subcommand_segv_blocks_bootstrap_2026-08-16, 1, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/deployed_selfhost_test_subcommand_segv_blocks_bootstrap_2026-08-16.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    deployed_selfhost_test_subcommand_segv_blocks_bootstrap_2026-08-16, 2, "2026-11-09 status closed (obsolete premise): the crashing artifact release/x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/simple (md5 dcc9f8ea...) was untracked by 65c0ab53757 the same day, and the Stage-1 'bounded test ABI probe' gate text no longer exists in src/ or scripts/ at release/1.0.0 038a177965c. Re-file against a current deployed binary if test --help SEGVs again."

